# Run inside an Ascend compute allocation with the matching eager checkpoint.
# Replace the cutoff and element mapping with the saved model's values.
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
newton off
read_data system.data
neighbor 0.5 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
pair_style mff/torch 3.2 npu
pair_coeff * * model.pth H C O
velocity all create 300 20261025 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix integrator all nve
timestep 0.0005
thermo 10
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press
run 100
